			86
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδὸν αὐ.,</span> as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοτροπέω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be like oneself,</i> i.e.
